      "subject": "Information needed for your quote: LEAD-00000042-001",
      "body": "Thank you for your submission. To complete the quote we need the items below. One reply covering all of them is ideal.\n\nLocation\n1. Please provide: Property Address\n\nInsured\n2. How many people live in the home?\n\nPrimary Coverages\n3. Please provide: Coverage A (Dwelling)\n4. Please provide: Coverage F (Medical Payments) (one of: 1000, 3000, 5000)\n\nProperty\n5. Please provide: Dwelling Use (one of: Owner Occupied Single Family Residence, Owner Occupied Multi Family Residence, Secondary Residence, Seasonal Residence)\n\nConstruction\n6. Please provide: Structure Type (one of: Single Family, Duplex, Townhouse, Rowhome, Other)\n7. Please provide: Number of Stories\n8. Please provide: Roof Shape (one of: Hip, Flat, Gable, Other)\n9. Please provide: Electrical Panel Brand (one of: Federal Pacific, Stab-Lok, Zinsco, Challenger, Sylvania, Square D, Eaton, Siemens, GE, Other, Unknown)\n10. Please provide: Electrical Panel Size (amps)\n\nPlumbing\n11. Please provide: Water Heater Type (one of: Tank, Tankless)\n\nProtection\n12. Please provide: Fire Protective Devices (one of: None, Local Alarm, Central Alarm, Direct Alarm)\n13. Please provide: Distance to Nearest Fire Hydrant (Feet)",
